# CR 616.1: Nourish gains 6 life while Rhox Faithmender ("twice that much")
# and Angel of Vitality ("that much plus 1") both replace the gain. The
# affected player chooses the order (ReplacementHandler.run, the decider is
# the Affected player). Candidates are offered in play order, so 0 is the
# Faithmender. It goes first: 6 -> 12, then CR 616.1f lets the plus-1 apply to
# what is left of the event: 13. Life 20 + 13 = 33.
queue replacement 0
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
castspell human 1
resolvestack
